      "description": "Spontaneous application | ESCP Business School With your agreement, We Recruit and our partners use cookies or similar technologies to store, access, and process personal data like your visit on this website, IP addresses and cookie identifiers. Some partners do not ask for your consent to process your data and rely on their legitimate business interest. You can withdraw your consent or object to data processing based on legitimate interest at any time by clicking on “Learn More” or in our Privacy Policy on this website. View our 8 partners Learn More → Disagree and close Agree and close Menu Company page Espace Carrière & Mobilité des salariés ESCP Plus Recrutement en Europe Site ESCP See our jobs EN EN FR Company page Espace Carrière & Mobilité des salariés ESCP Recrutement en Europe Site ESCP EN Retour EN EN FR See our jobs Spontaneous application F/H Apply to this job Apply Spontaneous application F/H Title * Mrs. Mr. Mx Last name * First name * E-mail * Phone number * Photo Choose file Format: JPG \nWeight: max 2 MO. Resume * Choose file Format: .PDF,  .DOCX, .DOC. Weight: max 2 MO. Quel service de notre école vous intéresse ? * Select an answer Career Center Communication Executive Education - Formation Continue Extension School Faculté & Recherche Finance - Gestion Juridique & Gouvernance Marketing Programmes - Formation Initiale Ressources Humaines Services aux étudiants, Sport, Bibliothèque Services Généraux, Planification, Restauration Sustainability Systèmes d’information As part of your application on the career site of ESCP Business School , the information you provide is processed for the review of your profile, on the basis of pre-contractual measures and the legitimate interest of the company in building a CV database. Some data may be automatically analysed (parsing and pre-screening) via an Artificial Intelligence system. No decision is made solely by AI, as every application is reviewed by a recruiter. Regarding the use of AI: - Your data is not retained by our AI solution. - It is not used to train an AI model. - Processing is carried out exclusively on servers located within the European Union. - No transfer outside the EU is carried out. Regarding your data: Unless otherwise requested, your data is retained for a maximum of 2 years. In accordance with our internal security policies (PSSI) and current best practices, robust technical and organisational measures are implemented to protect the access and integrity of your information: secure access, rights management, encryption, security protocols, access monitoring, employee awareness, etc. Regarding your rights: In accordance with the GDPR, you have the right to access, rectify, object to and delete your data. You may exercise these rights by contacting dpo@septeo.com. Apply Please answer to all required questions. Mandatory fields are followed by * * Required fields Our last jobs Chargé, chargée de scolarité M2 F/H Temporary contract\n- 6 months Full time Paris I apply Program officer – Apprenticeship F/H Apprenticeship\n- 12 months Full time Paris I apply Communications Intern (3–6 months) F/H Internship\n- 6 months Full time Paris I apply European Financial Controller – Degree Programmes Business Unit F/H Permanent contract Full time Levallois-Perret I apply See more jobs Follow us Jobs Spontaneous application Useful links Terms of Use Cookies Website map Recruiters access Consent choices Powered by Applicant Tracking System"
