    "https://careers.werecruit.io/en/escp-business-school/offers/procurement-officer-df097a": {
      "title": "Procurement Officer F/H",
      "description": "Procurement Officer F/H - Permanent contract in Paris | Découvrez nos offres Menu Company page Espace Carrière & Mobilité des salariés ESCP Recrutement en Europe Site ESCP Plus See our jobs EN EN FR Company page Espace Carrière & Mobilité des salariés ESCP Recrutement en Europe Site ESCP EN EN FR See our jobs Procurement Officer F/H Apply to this job Procurement Officer F/H I apply Published on               \n                28/09/2026 Contract type: Permanent contract Work time: Full time Location Paris The company ESCP Business School is the world-renowned business school, founded in 1819, that trains the responsible leaders of tomorrow. Located in the heart of Paris, it offers innovative and multicultural teaching, supported by a network of six European campuses. Recognized for the excellence of its management programs, it fosters engagement, international awareness, and personalized support for talent throughout their studies. Post description You will contribute to the day-to-day activities of the Procurement Department by managing the administrative and operational aspects of purchasing, suppliers, contracts, tenders, invoicing and reporting, ensuring business continuity and optimized spending. Your main responsibilities will include: Creating and monitoring purchase requisitions and orders in SAP through to receipt. Monitoring orders, deliveries and supplies, and verifying competitive bidding procedures or supply contracts. Managing administrative relations with suppliers and keeping master data up to date. Receiving, checking and matching invoices with purchase orders, and preparing them for approval in coordination with the relevant departments. Monitoring payments with the Accounting Department and contributing to periodic closing activities. Identifying and following up on discrepancies and disputes relating to orders, contracts or invoices until they are resolved. Updating dashboards, producing performance indicators and participating in internal audits. Acting as a business partner to the operational departments by supporting and, when appropriate, optimizing their purchasing activities, including negotiating supply prices whenever possible in partnership with the relevant departments. Occasionally participating in competitive bidding processes, drafting specifications, analyzing bids and archiving contracts. Profile required You have 3 to 5 years of experience in a similar role. Good knowledge of Procure-to-Pay (P2P) processes. Proficiency in an ERP system, ideally SAP. Strong organizational skills, attention to detail, ability to prioritize and analytical mindset. Excellent interpersonal and customer-service skills. Ability to work collaboratively with operational teams, Finance, Accounting and suppliers. Professional proficiency in English. Required languages English - Level advanced Réf: df097ab9-5293-4e44-a960-60c17dd006eb Apply Procurement Officer F/H Permanent contract Full time Paris Title * Mrs. Mr. Mx Last name * First name * E-mail * Phone number * Availability * Select your availability immediate 2 weeks 1 month 2 months 3 months > 3 months Salary expectations (Gross/year) * Select a salary expectation Inferior than 15 000€ 15 000€ - 20 000€ 20 000€ - 25 000€ 25 000€ - 30 000€ 30 000€ - 35 000€ 35 000€ - 40 000€ 40 000€ - 45 000€ 45 000€ - 50 000€ 50 000€ - 55 000€ 55 000€ - 60 000€ 60 000€ - 65 000€ 65 000€ - 70 000€ 70 000€ - 75 000€ 75 000€ - 80 000€ 80 000€ - 85 000€ Superior than 85 000€ Photo Choose file Format: JPG \nWeight: max 2 MO. Resume * Choose file Format: .PDF,  .DOCX, .DOC. Weight: max 2 MO. Quel est votre niveau d'anglais ? * Select an answer Beginner Intermediary Advanced Bilingual Pourquoi souhaitez vous rejoindre ESCP Business School ? As part of your application on the career site of ESCP Business School , the information you provide is processed for the review of your profile, on the basis of pre-contractual measures and the legitimate interest of the company in building a CV database. Some data may be automatically analysed (parsing and pre-screening) via an Artificial Intelligence system. No decision is made solely by AI, as every application is reviewed by a recruiter. Regarding the use of AI: - Your data is not retained by our AI solution. - It is not used to train an AI model. - Processing is carried out exclusively on servers located within the European Union. - No transfer outside the EU is carried out. Regarding your data: Unless otherwise requested, your data is retained for a maximum of 2 years. In accordance with our internal security policies (PSSI) and current best practices, robust technical and organisational measures are implemented to protect the access and integrity of your information: secure access, rights management, encryption, security protocols, access monitoring, employee awareness, etc. Regarding your rights: In accordance with the GDPR, you have the right to access, rectify, object to and delete your data. You may exercise these rights by contacting dpo@septeo.com. Apply Please answer to all required questions. Mandatory fields are followed by * * Required fields Share job Our last jobs HR Coordinator (Maternity Cover) F/M ESCP Business School London Campus Temporary contract\n- 16 months Part time London I apply Procurement Officer F/H Permanent contract Full time Paris I apply Technical Real Estate Project Manager – Client-Side Project Management – 18-month Fixed-Term Contract F/H Temporary contract\n- 18 months Full time Paris I apply Internships officer F/H Permanent contract Full time Paris I apply See more jobs Follow us Jobs Spontaneous application Useful links Terms of Use Cookies Website map Recruiters access Consent choices Powered by Applicant Tracking System"
